# The same bad revision with the analysis gate removed.
#
# Stock Argo advances on Ready. A pod that loads its model successfully IS Ready, and
# --max-num-seqs=1 loads fine, so the rollout proceeds happily to completion: every
# replica is replaced with a degraded one and there is no automatic recovery.
EXTRA_VLLM_ARGS="--reasoning-parser qwen3 --max-num-seqs=1"
ROLLOUT_ANALYSIS=off
